#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Fixture repo: a draft decision doc with three seeded defects (no rounding direction, two readings of
# "center", a scope claim that ignores adjacent slots).
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p docs/decisions
cat > docs/decisions/README.md <<'R'
# Decisions

Short records of settled decisions.
R
cat > docs/decisions/edge-label-placement.md <<'D'
# Edge label placement

Status: proposed

## Decision

Each edge label is placed at the center of its edge's slot. The label's left x is
`(slotWidth - labelWidth) / 2` from the slot's left edge. The center of the label then sits on
the edge's center line.

Sub-issue #2001 (render the labels) needs no spacing pass, because every label is drawn in its
own slot.
D
